px;\"><br /> <i>The Realm of the Dragon-Blooded stands astride the ruins of the First Age, an empire that touches every land in Creation. For hundreds of years, its Scarlet Empress clenched an iron fist around the throat of the world. But now the Empress is gone, and the Realm spirals ever towards civil war. Enemies bare their fangs at the gates of empire, while hidden agents work in Heaven\u2019s name to break the tides of chaos. Dark powers prepare to conquer the lands of the living, and in the spaces between walk beings both alive and not. Heroes come from thwarted destinies and lost worlds and the horrors of Hell itself, or they are Chosen by lesser gods to champion a cause. Some Exalted are found in time-lost vaults awaiting their final destiny, and some of the Exalted are reborn as heroes of legend long hunted by the Realm but now free to seize their own fate.</i> <br /> <img src=\"https://ksr-ugc.imgix.net/assets/033/663/814/de4b06393bea9699b07de411604cf7d0_original.png?ixlib=rb-4.0.2&amp;w=700&amp;fit=max&amp;v=1622052763&amp;auto=format&amp;frame=1&amp;lossless=true&amp;s=930cda27c9ae6516c86bb99043efbd25\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <br /> <b>Exalted: Essence</b> features streamlined rules for a new way of playing a classic game, incorporating story-focused action and a presentation designed to appeal to new players and longtime fans alike. Featuring multiple classic Exalt types with Charms for each, written to enable ease of play, <b>Exalted: Essence</b> emphasizes story over character, character over mechanics, and mechanics over minutiae in order to drive <b>Exalted: Essence</b> toward engaging players with the myriad stories they can tell in the world of Creation.<br /> </div></div> </div> </div><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/51-marin","name":"marin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2019"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-27T09:08:27-07:00","id":1449809,"title":"","content":"Daylight saving hours is messing me up.<br /> <br /> It is about one hour from now, yes?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://www.redbubble.com/people/nesling/works/15673780-loch-ness-monster-on-vacation?c=409846-mixed&amp;p=throw-pillow\" target=\"_blank\">Loch Ness monsters. On vacation. On a pillow.</a><br /> <br /> <br /> My wife is on <a href=\"https://open.spotify.com/artist/1Ngo336SKXWmoRnG3QWmhS\" target=\"_blank\">Spotify</a>!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/864-jutlander","name":"Jutlander","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"467"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-27T10:05:36-07:00","id":1449815,"title":"","content":"Yes it is.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8719-florin","name":"Florin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"940"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-27T11:06:12-07:00","id":1449828,"title":"","content":"Got my pledge in. It's already got a few thousand.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-27T11:56:30-07:00","id":1449850,"title":"","content":"Pledged. Already fully funded. <br /> <br /> Although I am mildly perturbed by the 2023 publishing date. If it's playable enough for a Twitch stream already, why is it going to take 2 years to finalise?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://wondrousatlas.wordpress.com\" target=\"_blank\">Wondrous Atlas of Creation's Destiny</a> - I cohost an Exalted podcast focusing on examining the setting's lore and how to develop them into elements to use in games.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/924488-homebuilt-exalted-st-screen-reference-sheet\" target=\"_blank\">Ex3 Reference Materials</a> - currently includes an ST screen, common actions sheet, weapons reference sheet, character creation summary and mortal QCs reference sheet.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/497-xerxes","name":"Xerxes","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar497_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"557"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-27T12:14:42-07:00","id":1449853,"title":"","content":"They always over estimate the delivery date. After the original Ex3 debacle, they've been extra careful.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/753-ariketh","name":"Ariketh","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"66"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-27T12:14:47-07:00","id":1449854,"title":"","content":"I took the 60$ pledge, but I'm a bit annoyed by the 40$ shipping cost. Can't wait to have the next chapters available !","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>My homebrew (Leave comments if you want to help improve) : <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1hPx-Q2jlDgAIZX_d0wQWmJkZMN51jas4QNp5meeQjgo/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">A quick recap of all the pools and stats for Quick Exalted 3E characters</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24291-chausse","name":"Chausse","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24291_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1139"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-27T12:57:47-07:00","id":1449862,"title":"","content":"So I'm looking, and sorta interested.<br /> Question for people who know more.<br /> Would it (Exalted Essence) help me add in unpublished exalt types into a standard EX3 game (charms anima powers etc)? I noted it has a character conversation section but unsure of just how much work it entails (I'm completely rubbish at e3 charm creation as is).<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/977-major","name":"Major","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar977_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"326"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-27T13:01:10-07:00","id":1449863,"title":"","content":"Two hours in and the campaign is fully funded and has raised $102,000. Good job everyone!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1411-wingnut2292","name":"wingnut2292","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1411_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"52"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-27T14:04:42-07:00","id":1449872,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Major</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1449352-essence-ks-27th-may-21?p=1449862#post1449862\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So I'm looking, and sorta interested.<br /> Question for people who know more.<br /> Would it (Exalted Essence) help me add in unpublished exalt types into a standard EX3 game (charms anima powers etc)? I noted it has a character conversation section but unsure of just how much work it entails (I'm completely rubbish at e3 charm creation as is).</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Unknown, they haven't released that part of the book to backers yet.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Exalted Whose Name is Carved in Leaves of Jade<br /> Senator of the Greater Chamber<br /> Champion of the Silver Pact<br /> Chosen of the Little Gods<br /> Agent of Fate","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/988-mizu","name":"Mizu","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar988_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1520"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-27T15:27:25-07:00","id":1449878,"title":"","content":"I backed. I'm so easy.<br /> <br /> No, I'm really curious about this. Ex3 didn't gel with me, for several reasons; some depending on the product, others on my life changing. I'm hoping ExE (is there an accepted acronym yet?) might be a more casual way to get back into Exalted.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Dex Davican wrote:</b> I can say without exaggeration or dishonesty that I am the most creative man <i>ever to have lived</i>","edited":{"userid":75,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/75-weimann","user":"Weimann","date":". 05-27-2021, 06:38 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/75-weimann","name":"Weimann","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar75_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1279"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-27T15:57:48-07:00","id":1449882,"title":"","content":"Neall described it as being of similar mechancial complexity as non-Mage CofD or D&amp;D 5e.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8719-florin","name":"Florin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"940"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-27T15:59:06-07:00","id":1449883,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Weimann</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1449352-essence-ks-27th-may-21?p=1449878#post1449878\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I backed. I'm so easy.<br /> <br /> No, I'm really curious about this. Ex3 didn't gel with me, for several reasons; some depending on the product, others on my life changing. I'm hoping ExE (is there an accepted acronym yet?) might be a more casual way to get back into Exalted.</div> </div> </div> </div>We've been playing ex3 it pretty steady since the beta PDF came out but that said not a session goes by without someone saying something about not understanding the rules. I am pretty sure there still hasn't been a single rush action every preformed ever (and of course, no one ever bothers with gambits).<br /> <br /> I'm on the fence. I know some players would like a reduced ruleset but I also don't want to have to redo everything.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/977-major","name":"Major","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar977_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"326"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-27T16:56:33-07:00","id":1449891,"title":"","content":"Acronyms I\u2019ve seen have included XS and ExEss<br /> <br /> Am I the only one who noticed the Scroll of Heroes roles in the preview?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1424-ghanjrho","name":"GhanjRho","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1424_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"126"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-27T17:34:42-07:00","id":1449894,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Major</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1449352-essence-ks-27th-may-21?p=1449883#post1449883\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> We've been playing ex3 it pretty steady since the beta PDF came out but that said not a session goes by without someone saying something about not understanding the rules. I am pretty sure there still hasn't been a single rush action every preformed ever (and of course, no one ever bothers with gambits).<br /> <br /> I'm on the fence. I know some players would like a reduced ruleset but I also don't want to have to redo everything.</div> </div> </div> </div>Appendix will provide a character Conversion section if it helps.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/893-reaperfrost8","name":"reaperfrost8","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar893_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"401"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-27T18:46:10-07:00","id":1449900,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>reaperfrost8</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1449352-essence-ks-27th-may-21?p=1449894#post1449894\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Appendix will provide a character Conversion section if it helps.</div> </div> </div> </div>Ah yeah, that's what my original question was about. The feel and usability of said chapter.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/977-major","name":"Major","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar977_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"326"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-28T05:02:55-07:00","id":1449965,"title":"","content":"Is that the Caste Mark of Slayers making a return in <a href=\"https://ksr-ugc.imgix.net/assets/033/419/599/21e2099e5dff4305836495b0a2ab978a_original.jpg?ixlib=rb-4.0.2&amp;w=680&amp;fit=max&amp;v=1620337192&amp;auto=format&amp;frame=1&amp;q=92&amp;s=6dfb3159cbd01e04179ec07bcf6a4d51\" target=\"_blank\">that image of a Sidereal, an Infernal, and a Lunar exploring a tomb</a>?<br /> <br /> If it is, I am not sure I like it. At all.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://www.redbubble.com/people/nesling/works/15673780-loch-ness-monster-on-vacation?c=409846-mixed&amp;p=throw-pillow\" target=\"_blank\">Loch Ness monsters. On vacation. On a pillow.</a><br /> <br /> <br /> My wife is on <a href=\"https://open.spotify.com/artist/1Ngo336SKXWmoRnG3QWmhS\" target=\"_blank\">Spotify</a>!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/864-jutlander","name":"Jutlander","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"467"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-28T05:39:23-07:00","id":1449968,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Jutlander</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1449352-essence-ks-27th-may-21?p=1449965#post1449965\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Is that the Caste Mark of Slayers making a return in <a href=\"https://ksr-ugc.imgix.net/assets/033/419/599/21e2099e5dff4305836495b0a2ab978a_original.jpg?ixlib=rb-4.0.2&amp;w=680&amp;fit=max&amp;v=1620337192&amp;auto=format&amp;frame=1&amp;q=92&amp;s=6dfb3159cbd01e04179ec07bcf6a4d51\" target=\"_blank\">that image of a Sidereal, an Infernal, and a Lunar exploring a tomb</a>?<br /> <br /> If it is, I am not sure I like it. At all.</div> </div> </div> </div>It's a nod to it, but I wouldn't say it's the same - it looks like a straight X, not curved swords. (We got a text description of the Horizon Caste mark - the Twilight-equivalents - and it doesn't resemble the Defiler Caste mark at all; it resembles the Twilight mark, but with starburst rays where the solid upper circle is.)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/51-marin","name":"marin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2019"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-28T06:37:42-07:00","id":1449971,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>marin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1449352-essence-ks-27th-may-21?p=1449968#post1449968\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> It's a nod to it, but I wouldn't say it's the same - it looks like a straight X, not curved swords. (We got a text description of the Horizon Caste mark - the Twilight-equivalents - and it doesn't resemble the Defiler Caste mark at all; it resembles the Twilight mark, but with starburst rays where the solid upper circle is.)</div> </div> </div> </div>If you zoom in, it looks like a straight X layered over/under a four pointed star, too.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/7Vopxta.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><b><i>Exalted Behind a Screen of Jade, Savant of the Immaculate Texts, No Moon Scholar</i>, Good Sitting Dog, Best Lurking Cat with Bones, Pioneer Pooch, Corsair, <i>Director, Keeper of the Karstein Manor</i>, Scion with Shield of Knowledge, Erymanthian Boar,<i> Seeking Awakened, Cloaked Changeling, Family Head, Kindred, Agent, Poltergeist</i>, Disciple of the Antler Crown, Wraith, Conspiracy Theorist, <i>First Time Traveler</i></b></div>","edited":{"userid":882,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/882-samuraimujuru","user":"SamuraiMujuru","date":". 05-28-2021, 09:42 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/882-samuraimujuru","name":"SamuraiMujuru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar882_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1129"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-28T13:18:20-07:00","id":1450054,"title":"","content":"I have to admit that even if you're not interested in the system, chapter One is one of the best &quot;broad scope&quot; looks at the world of Exalted I've ever seen.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1458-newk","name":"NewK","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"360"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-28T19:09:24-07:00","id":1450121,"title":"","content":"Just started reading the backer preview.<br /> <br /> I am loving the Inspirations sidebars that talk about which places in Creation were inspired by which IRL cultures, what sort of names are common in different parts of Creation, etc. This is <i>extremely</i> useful information to have.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11237-jefepato","name":"Jefepato","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11237_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"557"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-29T06:41:03-07:00","id":1450167,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Jefepato</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1449352-essence-ks-27th-may-21?p=1450121#post1450121\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I am loving the Inspirations sidebars that talk about which places in Creation were inspired by which IRL cultures, what sort of names are common in different parts of Creation, etc. This is <i>extremely</i> useful information to have.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah, definitely. One of the best things so far.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Dex Davican wrote:</b> I can say without exaggeration or dishonesty that I am the most creative man <i>ever to have lived</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/75-weimann","name":"Weimann","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar75_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1279"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-29T14:44:04-07:00","id":1450230,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Jefepato</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1449352-essence-ks-27th-may-21?p=1450121#post1450121\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Just started reading the backer preview.<br /> <br /> I am loving the Inspirations sidebars that talk about which places in Creation were inspired by which IRL cultures, what sort of names are common in different parts of Creation, etc. This is <i>extremely</i> useful information to have.</div> </div> </div> </div>Which update is that in? I pledged but havn't been reading the updates thoroughly<br /> <br /> Update: nevermind. Didn't see the link. Reading it","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1047,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1047-vampire-hunter-d","user":"vampire hunter D","date":". 05-29-2021, 05:47 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1047-vampire-hunter-d","name":"vampire hunter D","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1047_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1727"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-30T06:57:40-07:00","id":1450310,"title":"","content":"I'm very happy with the sneak peek of the Terrestrials. Big fan of the way they elegantly tied them into their organisational advantage with the Prince of the Earth advantage.<br /> <br /> Also very happy that the two first Fire Aspect Anima effects are social in nature. I feel like it's easy for fire to go &quot;big damage&quot; as a base line, and having that not happen until the iconic Anima effect lifts the other side of the Fire Aspect very nicely.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Dex Davican wrote:</b> I can say without exaggeration or dishonesty that I am the most creative man <i>ever to have lived</i>","edited":{"userid":75,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/75-weimann","user":"Weimann","date":". 05-30-2021, 10:17 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/75-weimann","name":"Weimann","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar75_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1279"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-31T00:53:57-07:00","id":1450411,"title":"","content":"I'm noticing that some 2e-isms have crept back into Essence, like the mortal-killing miasma of Malfeas and (from the Solars preview) Creature of Darkness status being the Sun's shitlist.<br /> <br /> I quite like what I'm seeing in the DB preview (gordonramsay.jpg). The Great Curse stuff doesn't grab me, but it's not <i>bad </i>either<i>.</i>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/97-the-mg","name":"The MG","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar97_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2460"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-31T01:39:02-07:00","id":1450415,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The MG</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1449352-essence-ks-27th-may-21?p=1450411#post1450411\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm noticing that some 2e-isms have crept back into Essence, like the mortal-killing miasma of Malfeas and (from the Solars preview) Creature of Darkness status being the Sun's shitlist.</div> </div> </div> </div>The first one's getting cut, the CoD's getting revised.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/51-marin","name":"marin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2019"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-31T13:40:05-07:00","id":1450495,"title":"","content":"Today's sneak peek were the first pieces of mechanics I've seen on Getimians at all. It's interesting that they get bonuses from the current size of their mote pools. Given that other Exalts have been getting their Essence in bonuses, that suggests something about the relative size of mote pools in ExE, and gives some perspective on how difficult and risky it might be to activate an Iconic Anima effect.<br /> <br /> Very eager to see the base system and the full basic Exalt types tomorrow!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Dex Davican wrote:</b> I can say without exaggeration or dishonesty that I am the most creative man <i>ever to have lived</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/75-weimann","name":"Weimann","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar75_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1279"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-31T13:51:54-07:00","id":1450497,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Weimann</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1449352-essence-ks-27th-may-21?p=1450495#post1450495\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Very eager to see the base system and the full basic Exalt types tomorrow!</div> </div> </div> </div> The base system is next week. Tomorrow is just the Exalted and chargen (possibly -- hopefully -- including Merits).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/97-the-mg","name":"The MG","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar97_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2460"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-31T14:31:28-07:00","id":1450507,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The MG</strong> <a